{"seq":4,"slug":"network-propagation","title":"网络传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/network-propagation","wordCount":1399,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络传播\">网络传播</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络传播（Network Propagation）研究信息、疾病、谣言、故障等实体在网络中扩散的动力学过程。传播动力学揭示了网络拓扑结构如何决定传播速度、范围和模式。对软件工程师而言，理解传播模型有助于分析故障扩散、信息分发和产品采用过程。</p>\n<p>传播模型的基本框架来自流行病学。SIR（易感-感染-恢复）模型和 SIS（易感-感染-易感）模型是两个基础模型。在 SIR 模型中，个体从易感状态（S）转变为感染状态（I），然后恢复（R）并获得免疫。在 SIS 模型中，恢复后的个体回到易感状态，可以被再次感染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph SIR 模型&#10;    A[S: 易感] --&gt;|感染率 β| B[I: 感染]&#10;    B --&gt;|恢复率 γ| C[R: 恢复]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph SIS 模型&#10;    D[S: 易感] --&gt;|感染率 β| E[I: 感染]&#10;    E --&gt;|恢复率 γ| D&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 软件映射&#10;    F[正常服务] --&gt;|故障传播| G[故障服务]&#10;    G --&gt;|恢复| H[恢复服务/正常服务]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph SIR 模型\n    A[S: 易感] --&gt;|感染率 β| B[I: 感染]\n    B --&gt;|恢复率 γ| C[R: 恢复]\n  end\n  subgraph SIS 模型\n    D[S: 易感] --&gt;|感染率 β| E[I: 感染]\n    E --&gt;|恢复率 γ| D\n  end\n  subgraph 软件映射\n    F[正常服务] --&gt;|故障传播| G[故障服务]\n    G --&gt;|恢复| H[恢复服务/正常服务]\n  end</pre><p>传播模型与软件系统现象的映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播模型</th>\n<th>流行病学含义</th>\n<th>软件系统映射</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SIR</td>\n<td>感染后获得永久免疫</td>\n<td>安全补丁：修复后不再受同一漏洞影响</td>\n<td>β/γ (基本再生数 R₀)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SIS</td>\n<td>感染后可再次感染</td>\n<td>间歇性故障：恢复后可能再次故障</td>\n<td>β/γ, 稳态感染比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEIR</td>\n<td>感染后有潜伏期</td>\n<td>配置变更：部署后延迟生效的影响</td>\n<td>β, σ (潜伏期), γ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SI</td>\n<td>一旦感染永不恢复</td>\n<td>技术债务：一旦引入难以完全消除</td>\n<td>β, 最终感染范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>基本再生数 R₀ = β/γ 是传播动力学中最关键的参数。当 R₀ &gt; 1 时，传播呈指数增长；当 R₀ &lt; 1 时，传播自然消退。在软件系统中，故障的&quot;R₀&quot;取决于每个故障服务平均影响多少个健康服务。熔断器的作用就是将 R₀ 降低到 1 以下，阻断故障的级联传播。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络结构对传播的影响\">网络结构对传播的影响</h2><p>传播动力学与网络拓扑深度耦合。在无标度网络中，Hub 节点既是超级传播者（如果被感染，可以迅速感染大量邻居），也是超级免疫目标（优先免疫 Hub 节点的效果远优于随机免疫）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PropagationSimulation {&#10;  graph: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;;&#10;  state: Map&lt;string, &#39;S&#39; | &#39;I&#39; | &#39;R&#39;&gt;;&#10;  beta: number;&#10;  gamma: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const simulateSIR = (&#10;  graph: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;,&#10;  initialInfected: string[],&#10;  beta: number,&#10;  gamma: number,&#10;  maxSteps: number,&#10;): Array&lt;{ step: number; s: number; i: number; r: number }&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const state = new Map&lt;string, &#39;S&#39; | &#39;I&#39; | &#39;R&#39;&gt;();&#10;  for (const node of graph.keys()) state.set(node, &#39;S&#39;);&#10;  for (const node of initialInfected) state.set(node, &#39;I&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const history: Array&lt;{ step: number; s: number; i: number; r: number }&gt; = [];&#10;&#10;  for (let step = 0; step &lt; maxSteps; step++) {&#10;    let s = 0,&#10;      i = 0,&#10;      r = 0;&#10;    for (const st of state.values()) {&#10;      if (st === &#39;S&#39;) s++;&#10;      else if (st === &#39;I&#39;) i++;&#10;      else r++;&#10;    }&#10;    history.push({ step, s, i, r });&#10;&#10;    if (i === 0) break;&#10;&#10;    const newStates = new Map(state);&#10;&#10;    for (const [node, st] of state) {&#10;      if (st === &#39;I&#39;) {&#10;        for (const neighbor of graph.get(node) ?? []) {&#10;          if (state.get(neighbor) === &#39;S&#39; &amp;&amp; Math.random() &lt; beta) {&#10;            newStates.set(neighbor, &#39;I&#39;);&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;        if (Math.random() &lt; gamma) {&#10;          newStates.set(node, &#39;R&#39;);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for (const [k, v] of newStates) state.set(k, v);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return history;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PropagationSimulation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'I'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'R'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simulateSIR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialInfected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'I'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'R'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) state.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initialInfected) state.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9EC